{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲说清了先前的疲惫、惊悸与重新浮现的向往如何共同推动前行，也说明无法挽回的压力为何使发力不能一次释放、柔弱的向往又如何逐渐取代单靠用力维持姿态的方式；但“想念让向前的力气聚起”“停滞也松动了些”等关键环节仍偏概括，没有充分展开身体如何先于明确念头作出反应，以及反复应对如何反过来改变下一刻的感受。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙把未获回应保证的在乎、身体本能的停顿、压轻期待却无法消除所求、反复发力留下的余压与末尾犹疑逐渐耗尽连成了较清楚的因果链，也具体说明了向前本身如何带来松动却不能转化为安心；不足是部分内心状态的推演较为确定，且若干心理转折仍主要依赖叙述来成立，未能完全说明其音乐上的可辨依据。\",\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙的优势不只是解释更长，而是更明确地交代了身体先停顿、压轻期待未能撤销在乎、残余压力累积并最终消耗犹疑的作用机制，因此比甲更具体地解释了此刻为何这样感受、为何转向行动，以及行动为何带来有限的解脱而非真正的安心。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a0cf0def-d8dd-4e21-9299-2217f1f8ee01", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T135223757711Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.797, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:53:11.547452+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b7d00e48d215490f7f5f6df42732815f5474821d7f3ae9186b49857bae84ecf4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8